# Invert: .gitignore everything, so invert what we want to NOT .gitignore
/*

# Standard Repo Files
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
# Belt-and-braces: re-ignore the public-mirror workflow's runtime
# artifact so it can never be accidentally committed from the source
# tree. The .github/** un-ignore above would otherwise make this
# generated file git-add-able. This negation must come AFTER that
# un-ignore — gitignore is last-match-wins (see issue #157 / PR #159).
.github/public-mirror/replacements.clean.txt
!/LICENSE
!/PATENTS
!/PRIOR_ART.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.markdownlint.jsonc
# Static informational file shipped to the public mirror through
# git-filter-repo (issue #208). Must be tracked here so it ships.
!/CONTRIBUTORS

# Marketplace content — whitelist the manifest and plugin directories,
# ignore everything else by default. New tooling-generated dirs (cache,
# sessions, projects, todos, ...) stay ignored unless added here.
# Re-including a file inside an ignored dir requires un-ignoring each
# parent first (git's negation rule).
!/.claude-plugin/
!/.claude-plugin/**
!/plugins/
!/plugins/**
!/docs/
!/docs/**

# Per-repo config for /issue-address and friends. Lives in the
# *nested* .claude/ (this repo's root IS ~/.claude, so .claude/ here
# is the per-repo config for using ~/.claude on itself). Each parent
# must be un-ignored before the file becomes visible to git.
!/.claude/
!/.claude/rules/
!/.claude/rules/repo-config.md

# Agent memory is local-only and never committed. Agents that declare
# `memory: project` keep writing here; none of it is repo content, so
# none of it is reviewed, swept as a doc surface, or evidence for a
# claim about this repo. A lesson worth keeping past the run that
# learned it lands in CLAUDE.md or /docs instead. This rule sits after
# the !/.claude/ whitelist above so last-match-wins makes it effective.
/.claude/agent-memory/

# Always ignore local/temp/backup/lock files anywhere under .claude/,
# even inside whitelisted directories
/**/*.local.*
/**/*.backup.*
/**/*.lock
/**/tmp/
/**/worktrees/

# Repo-root CLAUDE override files (sibling to CLAUDE.md)
/CLAUDE.local.*

# Backup files from Claude setup
*.backup.*

#
# Below this should be excluded, but it is belt-and-braces
#

# macOS Finder metadata and temp dirs
.DS_Store
__MACOSX/

# macOS system files
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon
._*

# Git repo metadata
.git/

# Misc
*.log
*.tmp

#VSCode swapfile
*.swp

# --- mise (managed by macos-setup `make asdf-to-mise`) ---
# mise.toml is the ONE tracked config form; it is deliberately NOT
# ignored. Everything below is either machine-local or a
# non-canonical location we do not use.
/mise.local.toml
/mise/config.toml
/.mise/config.toml
/.config/mise.toml
/.config/mise/config.toml
/.config/mise/conf.d/
# --- end mise ---

# --- direnv/asdf ---
.envrc
.tool-versions
# --- end direnv/asdf ---
